  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>⋅</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> represents the greatest integer part of <math><mi>x</mi></math>), then the range of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
