  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
